==== Switch Ports (for VLANs) ====

In the current release this router is using the DSA [[https://www.kernel.org/doc/html/latest/networking/dsa/dsa.html|(Distributed Switch Architecture)]] switch architecture.  See [[docs:guide-user:network:dsa:start]] for more information 

LAN ports are labeled in OpenWrt as they are on the router itself e.g : lan1-lan4 and the WAN port is wan, the ethernet switch is eth0
The physical numbering on the ports matches this.

