===== Notes and known issues =====
//Space for additional notes, links to forum threads or other resources.//

  * ( **feb 2022** ) setting up a mesh network seems to work initially but after some time the mesh setup gets broken and a kernel WARN is thrown.  This only seems to apply to mesh.  WDS functions properly as tested.  This problem is documented in this forum post https://forum.openwrt.org/t/kernel-warn-tp-link-c6u-mesh-network-not-possible-general-networking-becomes-unusable/120554
  * ( **feb 2022** ) Some users are reporting IRQ related issues.  https://forum.openwrt.org/t/tp-link-archer-c6u-mt7615-interrupts-problem/117770/4 
  * ( **feb 2022** ) DFS functionality does't seem to work when using channels that require it per regulatory domain for wifi cards MT7613 .  Both stable and snapshot at the time of writing .  See https://forum.openwrt.org/t/mt76-mt7613-radio-and-dfs-support/88915/
  * ( **feb 2022** ) Post of general impression of this router functionality can be found : https://forum.openwrt.org/t/tp-link-archer-c6u-impressions-test-configuration-stability-functionality-feedback/121020
